gix.net/e04b0838/uploads/origins/2e99752a-d645-4b12-9bff-0215c4868619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41d08a25bf8fbc9c4b12f55da4550c30 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e04b0838/uploads/origins/2e99752a-d645-4b12-9bff-0215c4868619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed40afb539cdd9402bc28a1f33082841 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私はあなたの作品が大好きです。\n\n＜依頼内容＞\n・今回の依頼もbilibiliからのVUPなので！\n\n＜使用用途＞\n・ツイッターで使うかもしれない。\n・bilibiliの着せ替え画像として使用させていただきます。\n・イラストの使用用途は会員へのプレゼント\n\n＜構図＞\n・動作を自由に選択できます。\n\n＜資料＞\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1FEcZRD36CFdqJtF2k4hByHs_Zqo3dWAk/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TsukimiSD/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e27d89b/uploads/origins/f04497ef-7b77-4cce-9dcf-3c391b61ee53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74815035729c8bc4879cbe7ee3f5fb12", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3e27d89b/uploads/origins/f04497ef-7b77-4cce-9dcf-3c391b61ee53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74815035729c8bc4879cbe7ee3f5fb12, https://si.imgix.net/3e27d89b/uploads/origins/f04497ef-7b77-4cce-9dcf-3c391b61ee53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fb19b8ccf251497d050907b5aa55bd2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3e27d89b/uploads/origins/f04497ef-7b77-4cce-9dcf-3c391b61ee53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c8fea62429c943c253fd16365318f77 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "约约小丸幼稚园的QQ人~\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1FEcZRD36CFdqJtF2k4hByHs_Zqo3dWAk/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TsukimiSD/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/da189310/uploads/origins/768cb5aa-f6a5-4a01-89d9-7b685d33e7e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41f103acf38efb4086b905dfaae0760f", "thumbnai