、楽しく描いてもらえたら嬉しいです、ありがとうございました。\n私のOC参考画像：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KS-9IdxyiGZXg7kzs2qMyXhpc0JIIPmB/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1KS-9IdxyiGZXg7kzs2qMyXhpc0JIIPmB/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TsukimiSD/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/361669eb/uploads/origins/e2dae150-0752-44d3-8d4b-55a6ecc5d7ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fbc965fdecf3f2d2702e7ef5e4ea979", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/361669eb/uploads/origins/e2dae150-0752-44d3-8d4b-55a6ecc5d7ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fbc965fdecf3f2d2702e7ef5e4ea979, https://si.imgix.net/361669eb/uploads/origins/e2dae150-0752-44d3-8d4b-55a6ecc5d7ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f4f7380a68bb71ba8d17e1a5fc74f28 2x, https://si.imgix.net/361669eb/uploads/origins/e2dae150-0752-44d3-8d4b-55a6ecc5d7ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=507fee6536c48e81893ccc0e1fd97247 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "月见老师好，想给自设约一个qq人当头像用~\n服饰和自设参考：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qde4MEe8o-S_NLcVLmO4SuYvzO4fhRIW/view?usp=sharing\n希望小狐狸能顶在头上，其他请老师自由发挥，谢谢！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1qde4MEe8o-S_NLcVLmO4SuYvzO4fhRIW/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TsukimiSD/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8f40cde4/uploads/origins/6146192e-1508-4bf9-b437-790505a8e2cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=083e51ba574f29006dd86fff0955c893", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8f40cde4/uploads/origins/6146192e-1508-4bf9-b437-790505a8e2cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=083e51ba574f29006dd86fff0955c893, https://si.imgix.net/8f40cde4/uploads/origins/6146192e-1508-4bf9-b437-790505a8e2cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=cro